
The x86_64 code with optimization will result in FMA opcodes
within the fp_region() code.  However the fp_vbox() code does
not employ FMA.

0000000000007640 <fp_region>:
    7640:   c5 f0 57 c9             vxorps xmm1,xmm1,xmm1
